# Secrets & local machine config: NEVER commit
# .mcp.json is NOT ignored: the repo ships it with the one browser tool form filling needs
# (chrome-devtools, no keys). Add personal MCP servers with `claude mcp add` (local scope, kept
# outside the repo) or in a personal file loaded with `claude --mcp-config .mcp.local.json`.
.mcp.local.json
.env
.env.*
*.local
# Per-machine Claude Code settings (local hook paths, permission grants). The `*.local`
# glob above does NOT match this filename (it ends in .json), so name it explicitly.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Live working file (gitignored per ops/ convention in CLAUDE.md)
ops/STATE.md

# OS / tooling noise
.DS_Store
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Session scratch: never publish
.claude/tmp/

# Resume build fonts: if you keep per-application font copies, they're build inputs, not
# deliverables (the PDF is); uncomment if that gets noisy:
# applications/*/resume/fonts/
# applications/*/cover-letter/fonts/

# Generated output, rebuilt on demand
pipeline/job-crawler/cache/
pipeline/outreach-bundle-*.md
pipeline/job-feed.md
